<title>USA: Daschle - budget plan being discussed &quot;tough sell&quot;.</title>
<headline>Daschle - budget plan being discussed &quot;tough sell&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Senate Democratic Leader Tom Daschle said Thursday the budget plan under discussion between congressional and White House negotiators would be a &quot;tough sell&quot; to Democrats.</p>
<p>&quot;I think this is going to be a tough sell under any circumstances,&quot; the South Dakota Democrat told reporters.</p>
<p>He said he was concerned about the magnitude of tax cuts under discussion and the &quot;limited&quot; investment for education.</p>
</text>
